<h3 style="margin-top:20px">Kesepakatan dan tagihan awal</h3><dl class="lc-kv"><dt>Periode sewa</dt><dd><?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($pay,'stay_start')); ?> s.d. <?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($pay,'stay_end')); ?></dd><dt>Sewa bulanan</dt><dd><?= gh_lc_money(gh_lc_v($pay,'monthly_price',0)); ?></dd><dt>Deposit disepakati</dt><dd><?= gh_lc_money(gh_lc_v($pay,'deposit_required',0)); ?></dd><dt>Tagihan awal</dt><dd>#<?= (int)gh_lc_v($pay,'invoice_id',0); ?> · <?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($pay,'invoice_period')); ?></dd><dt>Nominal / terbayar</dt><dd><?= gh_lc_money(gh_lc_v($pay,'invoice_amount',0)); ?> / <?= gh_lc_money(gh_lc_v($pay,'rent_paid',0)); ?></dd><dt>Sisa sewa awal</dt><dd><?= gh_lc_money(gh_lc_v($pay,'rent_outstanding',0)); ?></dd><dt>Kekurangan deposit</dt><dd><?= gh_lc_money(gh_lc_v($pay,'deposit_outstanding',0)); ?></dd><?php if ((int)gh_lc_v($pay,'rent_credit',0)>0): ?><dt>Kelebihan pembayaran sewa</dt><dd><?= gh_lc_money($pay['rent_credit']); ?></dd><?php endif; ?><?php if ((int)gh_lc_v($pay,'deposit_credit',0)>0): ?><dt>Kelebihan pembayaran deposit</dt><dd><?= gh_lc_money($pay['deposit_credit']); ?></dd><?php endif; ?></dl><?php if ((int)gh_lc_v($pay,'rent_credit',0)>0 || (int)gh_lc_v($pay,'deposit_credit',0)>0): ?><p class="lc-note">Kelebihan pembayaran tetap tercatat. Nilai ini belum berarti dana telah ditransfer kembali; penyelesaian dicatat terpisah.</p><?php endif; ?><p class="lc-help">Bukti pembayaran penghuni tersedia di Dokumen privat. Lampiran merupakan klaim pembayaran; periksa transfer nyata dan catat transaksi sebelum verifikasi.</p><?php if($canFinance): ?><a class="lc-btn secondary" href="<?= base_url('payments?'.http_build_query(array('room_id'=>(int)$case['room_id'],'period_id'=>(int)gh_lc_v($pay,'invoice_period_id',0),'q'=>gh_lc_v($case,'full_name','')))); ?>">Buka transaksi tagihan awal</a><?php endif; ?><?php endif; ?>
